---
import { MessageCircle, Instagram, Youtube, ArrowUp } from 'lucide-react';
---

<footer class="footer">
  <div class="container">
    <!-- CTA Banner inside Footer -->
    <div class="footer-cta-banner brand-card-dark">
      <div class="cta-content">
        <span class="cta-badge">Tu próximo paso</span>
        <h2 class="cta-title">
          ¿Listo para dejar de empezar y abandonar?
        </h2>
        <p class="cta-desc">
          Empezá a construir el hábito de fuerza que te acompañará para siempre. Sin culpa y adaptado a tu vida.
        </p>
      </div>

      <a 
        href="https://wa.me/5493410000000?text=Hola%20Tomás!%20Quiero%20comenzar%20mi%20proceso%20de%20entrenamiento%20y%20hábitos" 
        target="_blank" 
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="btn btn-primary btn-lg"
      >
        <MessageCircle size={22} />
        <span>Hablar directamente con Tomás</span>
      </a>
    </div>

    <div class="footer-main">
      <div class="footer-brand">
        <a href="#" class="brand-logo-link">
          <img 
            src="/logo-signature-creme.png" 
            alt="Tomás Pussetto" 
            class="footer-signature-logo"
          />
        </a>

        <p class="footer-tagline-text">
          "El gimnasio no es para cambiar tu cuerpo. Es el lugar donde aprendés a cumplirte la palabra a vos mismo."
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="footer-links">
        <div class="footer-col">
          <h4>Navegación</h4>
          <a href="#filosofia">Filosofía</a>
          <a href="#ciclo">El Ciclo de Culpa</a>
          <a href="#quiz">Test de Adherencia</a>
          <a href="#historias">Historias Reales</a>
          <a href="#asesoria">Asesoría 1 a 1</a>
        </div>

        <div class="footer-col">
          <h4>Contacto & Redes</h4>
          <a href="https://instagram.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="social-link">
            <Instagram size={18} />
            <span>Instagram</span>
          </a>
          <a href="https://youtube.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="social-link">
            <Youtube size={18} />
            <span>YouTube</span>
          </a>
          <a href="https://wa.me/5493410000000" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="social-link">
            <MessageCircle size={18} />
            <span>WhatsApp Directo</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="footer-bottom">
      <p>© {new Date().getFullYear()} Tomás Pussetto. Todos los derechos reservados. Rosario, Argentina & Online Global.</p>
      <a href="#" class="back-to-top" aria-label="Volver arriba">
        <span>Volver arriba</span>
        <ArrowUp size={16} />
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>

<style>
  .footer {
    position: relative;
    padding: 5rem 0 3rem;
    background: var(--color-obsidian-dark);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-dark);
  }

  .footer-cta-banner {
    padding: 3.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 5rem;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 2rem;
    background: var(--color-espresso);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-dark);
  }

  .cta-badge {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-creme-muted);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  }

  .cta-title {
    font-size: 2rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    margin: 0.4rem 0 0.5rem;
    color: var(--color-creme);
  }

  .cta-desc {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    color: var(--color-creme-muted);
    max-width: 580px;
  }

  .footer-main {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 4rem;
    padding-bottom: 4rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-dark);
  }

  .brand-logo-link {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .footer-signature-logo {
    height: 65px;
    width: auto;
    object-fit: contain;
  }

  .footer-tagline-text {
    margin-top: 1.25rem;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--color-creme-muted);
    max-width: 380px;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .footer-links {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 2rem;
  }

  .footer-col {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.85rem;
  }

  .footer-col h4 {
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-creme);
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .footer-col a {
    color: var(--color-creme-muted);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    transition: color 0.2s ease;
  }

  .footer-col a:hover {
    color: var(--color-creme);
  }

  .social-link {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  .footer-bottom {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    padding-top: 2rem;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--color-creme-muted);
  }

  .back-to-top {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    color: var(--color-creme-muted);
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: color 0.2s ease;
  }

  .back-to-top:hover {
    color: var(--color-creme);
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .footer-cta-banner {
      flex-direction: column;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 2.5rem 1.5rem;
    }
    .footer-main {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 3rem;
    }
  }
</style>
